 result←object New arg;parent;name;props;newobj;tunits;punits;px;newpic;deffont
 (parent name)←object ⍝ Separate non-standard two-part argument

 props←'Printer'('Coord' 'RealPixel')('PagesBeginDirty' 0) ⍝ Set standard creation properties
 newobj←⎕VGET(parent⍕⍛,'.',name)##.##.∆WC props ⍝ Create the actual Dyalog object

 :Section ⍝ Set up special Printer parameters
     (newobj._units deffont)←_supp.SetUnits newobj ⍝ Each Printer has its own 'units' definition and default 'font'
     newobj._Ancestry←,parent ⍝ Fake this to check units
     (tunits punits)←2↑##._supp.MyUnits newobj ⍝ Set hard sizing of immovable object
     newobj.(_size _extent)←tunits punits÷⍨⊂px←⊃newobj ##.##.∆WG'DevCaps' ⍝ Figure out the logical printer size
     newobj._where←0 0,newobj._extent ⍝ _where & _extent are dummy information, just present so shared code will continue to work
     newobj._pixelmargin←_supp.SetMargin newobj ⍝ Each Printer has its own default margin setting
     newobj._collate_default←newobj ##.##.∆WG'Collate' ⍝ Determine default setting
     newobj._position←0 0 ⍝ Track "Print" position in pixels
     newobj._page←newobj._dirty←0 ⍝ Go ahead and initialize page variables
 :EndSection

 result←parent newobj ##.##.New.Initialize arg ⍝ Complete standard class-initialization procedure
 {}newobj ##.font deffont ⍝ Set the formal default font in the usual way

 ⍝ Now we'll create a Bitmap to use as our page-construction area
 ⍝ It will be written to the paper with an Image object when the page is completed
 props←⊂'Bitmap'
 props,←⊂'CBits'(px⍴¯1+⌊256*3) ⍝ Start with a completely white paper
 newpic←⎕VGET(newobj⍕⍛,'._pic')##.##.∆WC props ⍝ Create the hidden Dyalog object to hold the dynamic image
 ##.##.New.InitChild newobj newpic
